\subsection{Review questions}\label{c37-review-questions}

\begin{enumerate}
\def\labelenumi{\arabic{enumi}.}
\item
  Why does predicate negation use a different operator in D?
\item
  Which C++ lifetime problem disappears when PEG rules are reference
  objects?
\end{enumerate}
